      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "This is a huge drop in class for G1 winning mare GEEGEES MISTRUTH (1) and she clearly looks the one to beat. Two runs this time in have both been in G1 races against the boys, only beaten 2.25 lengths by Jimmysstar in the Manikato here last time. She's got 61kg but really isn't treated poorly and should be just about winning. PHOTOGRAPH (9) might be the main danger. She was good behind Custom fresh then stuck on fairly in the G3 How Now behind Point Barrow which is solid form. Don't mind her back to 1100m with Zahra on. STARDOM (5) didn't fire in the How Now last time, much prefer her back in trip off a good run fresh at Randwick, she can give a sight. SIGNATURE SCENT (8) has been mixing form, the win over Cavalry Girl back in July over this route reads well. EAGLE EXPRESS (7) is going solidly in Sydney and has some claims.",
